          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "How to Choose a Logo Design Company in Austin",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>The right logo design company should show real portfolio work, design every logo from scratch, include editable vector files, and be clear about price and revisions before you start. Local availability helps when you need quick answers or a same-day turnaround for an opening or event.</p><ul><li><strong>Portfolio:</strong> look for variety across industries. See the <a href=\"/portfolio/\">Logo Austin portfolio</a>.</li><li><strong>Process:</strong> ask how many concepts and revisions are included.</li><li><strong>Files:</strong> confirm you will receive AI or EPS source files, not only a JPG.</li><li><strong>Ownership:</strong> make sure the final logo is fully yours.</li><li><strong>Payment terms:</strong> know when and how you pay.</li></ul>",
           "classes": []
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
