          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Yes. Logo Austin is located at 7600 Chevy Chase Dr, Suite 300, Austin, TX 78752, and serves businesses across Austin and nearby cities by phone, text and email.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "How much does a logo cost at Logo Austin?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Custom logo design at Logo Austin is priced from $125 to $175. There is no upfront charge; you pay only after you approve the final design.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Do I need to visit the office?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>No. Most Logo Austin projects are completed entirely by phone, text and email, which keeps turnaround fast.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Can one logo work for print and online?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Yes. A single vector logo from Logo Austin can be used on business cards, flyers, posters, brochures, banners, websites and social media.</p>",
